charges through their body.

02:42:05.316 --> 02:42:05.750
What's the DC on that? 16?

02:42:06.450 --> 02:42:06.817
Sixteen dexterity.

02:42:09.020 --> 02:42:09.320
That's a fail.

02:42:10.588 --> 02:42:10.721
A fail.

02:42:11.289 --> 02:42:12.089
And a success!

02:42:12.823 --> 02:42:13.090
-Darn.
-Go ahead and roll damage.

02:42:13.624 --> 02:42:14.792
Alright.

02:42:15.593 --> 02:42:16.227
That's 11.

02:42:18.429 --> 02:42:20.598
-So, yeah.
-Alright.

02:42:21.532 --> 02:42:21.599
Alright.

02:42:22.967 --> 02:42:24.302
So, as it shocks
through them all,

02:42:25.102 --> 02:42:25.770
