instinct at this point.

02:42:34.845 --> 02:42:36.013
None of them fall, but they're
looking pretty damaged

02:42:37.715 --> 02:42:37.915
Are you gonna stay put
towards the back?

02:42:41.452 --> 02:42:41.852
As a bonus I'm going to teleport
a little but further

02:42:42.954 --> 02:42:43.788
just kind of...

02:42:44.922 --> 02:42:45.156
out of any physical range.

02:42:46.490 --> 02:42:46.757
Alright, so you just...

02:42:49.160 --> 02:42:49.594
You watch as Indra suddenly...

02:42:50.328 --> 02:42:51.362
vanishes from sight.

02:42:53.831 --> 02:42:54.465
You hear a footfalls
in the darkness behind you

02:42:55.399 --> 02:42:56.133
by about 20 or 30 or so feet.

02:42:56.867 --> 02:42:57.902
Alright,
finishing your go Indra,

02:42:58.970 --> 02:42:59.237
that brings us to Laslo
to run your own deck.

02:43:00.171 --> 02:43:00.671
Great.

02:43:03.040 --> 02:43:03.274
There's 2 in front of me now?

02:43:03.941 --> 02:43:04.375
There's 2 on me?

02:43:05.243 --> 02:43:05.710
There's 3 on you.

02:43:06.978 --> 02:43:07.812
Three on me, gotcha.

02:43:12.049 --> 02:43:12.183
I wanna grab 1 by the head
and cast Siphon Blood.

02:43:14.986 --> 02:43:16.687
-Okay, alrighty.
-That's cool.

02:43:17.788 --> 02:43:18.122
Okay.

02:43:19.323 --> 02:43:19.824
Go ahead
and roll attack on that one.

02:43:22.693 --> 02:43:23.127
That is a 12.

02:43:24.395 --> 02:43:24.762
Twelve just hits.

02:43:26.197 --> 02:43:27.164
So, as you reach out
and grab it and pull it in.

02:43:27.798 --> 02:43:28.766
In the light there,
you can see its eyes.

02:43:30.568 --> 02:43:31.202
A kind of odd,
milky-white greenish tint to it.

02:43:31.969 --> 02:43:33.004
What's the damage on that one?

02:43:34.472 --> 02:43:34.739
Nine.

02:43:36.474 --> 02:43:36.774
-Nine damage?
-Yeah.

02:43:37.475 --> 02:43:38.709
-Alright.
-Sorry.

02:43:40.711 --> 02:43:41.712
As you pull out of it you watch
as it screams and squeals

02:43:43.781 --> 02:43:44.749
and you pull whatever
element of life force

02:43:45.950 --> 02:43:47.018
remaining in this odd
and twisted abomination.

02:43:47.918 --> 02:43:49.020
It damages it heavily,

02:43:50.321 --> 02:43:51.289
but it still standing
and wriggling in your grasp.

02:43:53.524 --> 02:43:53.791
Although you do heal
1 D4 damage from that.

02:43:54.292 --> 02:43:54.992
Three.

02:43:56.460 --> 02:43:56.694
Okay, but don't forget to mark
your essence from that 1.

02:43:57.094 --> 02:43:58.095
Cool.

02:43:59.463 --> 02:43:59.730
Do you wanna stay put or
do you wish to move?

02:44:03.034 --> 02:44:03.868
As a bonus action,
I'd like to cast Devour.

02:44:06.003 --> 02:44:07.138
Devour would require
the corpses nearby.

02:44:08.673 --> 02:44:09.774
-Aren't there corpses nearby?
-Oh, there are, yeah!

02:44:10.808 --> 02:44:11.909
-Like a bunch of them.
-You can totally do that, yeah.

02:44:14.011 --> 02:44:14.378
I was like "They aren't dead...
Other people are?"

02:44:15.446 --> 02:44:15.746
Yeah you can.

02:44:17.415 --> 02:44:18.282
how many are fresh?

02:44:18.916 --> 02:44:20.051
-Within 30 feet?
-Five fresh corpses.

02:44:21.652 --> 02:44:25.756
In the sense that their essence
has not been taken.

02:44:26.791 --> 02:44:27.625
What a cheerful Necromancer.

02:44:30.428 --> 02:44:30.861
Nom, nom, nom.
Fresh corpses.

02:44:30.961 --> 02:44:32.363
Fresh baked bread.

02:44:33.264 --> 02:44:34.298
-Great.
-There you go.

02:44:35.066 --> 02:44:35.199
You go ahead and
get your essence on that one.

02:44:36.767 --> 02:44:38.202
And you're staying put?

02:44:40.771 --> 02:44:41.439
Will they get an attach
opportunity if I...

02:44:42.506 --> 02:44:42.907
-They would.
-They would?

02:44:45.509 --> 02:44:45.776
-Yeah, I'll stay put.
-You got it.

02:44:46.644 --> 02:44:47.545
That finishes Laslo's turn.

02:44:47.878 --> 02:44:48.879
Tauro, you're up,
Mordred, you're on deck.

02:44:51.949 --> 02:44:53.250
I am gonna try to shuffle
the 1 that's on me

02:44:55.653 --> 02:44:56.187
