02:45:04.829 --> 02:45:05.763
First 1 is a natural three,

02:45:06.330 --> 02:45:06.597
which I don't think it hits
with an 11.

02:45:07.631 --> 02:45:08.132
Just misses unfortunately.

02:45:08.332 --> 02:45:09.300
It's too close to you

02:45:10.868 --> 02:45:11.669
and it's writhing in your grasp
and goes wide.

02:45:15.039 --> 02:45:15.539
