is a natural 19 for 27.

02:45:15.840 --> 02:45:16.974
That definitely hits.

02:45:19.443 --> 02:45:21.078
Which is 1 D6.

02:45:23.214 --> 02:45:23.481
Okay, plus 8 damage.

02:45:24.615 --> 02:45:24.915
Nice.

02:45:26.217 --> 02:45:26.717
So that 1 also goes...

02:45:28.152 --> 02:45:29.053
