the open wound there.

02:45:31.589 --> 02:45:32.022
It's heavily hurt but it's still
holding on.

02:45:32.423 --> 02:45:34.492
Angry and hungry.

02:45:35.526 --> 02:45:37.695
Staying put?

02:45:38.396 --> 02:45:39.363
Yes.

02:45:40.197 --> 02:45:40.698
That finishes your go.
Mordred, you're up.

02:45:40.965 --> 02:45:41.999
Remy, you're on deck.

02:45:43.834 --> 02:45:44.502
"Roughly how many of these
are there to wound?"

02:45:46.504 --> 02:45:47.338
They're all pretty clustered
right now.

02:45:47.705 --> 02:45:48.973
You guys
are all in the same area.

02:45:50.841 --> 02:45:51.242
There are 10 of them currently
in the middle of this battle.

02:45:52.410 --> 02:45:53.310
All of them are within
15 or so feet from you.

02:45:54.745 --> 02:45:55.713
-"There's 1 on me?"
-There's 1 on you.

02:45:56.947 --> 02:45:57.948
