of physical damage.

02:46:11.162 --> 02:46:12.229
But you manage to pull away and
you're going to provoke.

02:46:15.099 --> 02:46:15.533
"All 10 of them need to beat
a DC14 Wisdom save."

02:46:18.302 --> 02:46:18.569
"And for every failure,
I rack up Wrath."

02:46:18.836 --> 02:46:19.103
Indeed.

02:46:19.804 --> 02:46:21.739
Alright.

02:46:23.607 --> 02:46:24.108
-What's the DC?
-Fourteen.

02:46:25.476 --> 02:46:26.110
First 1 is a success.

02:46:27.311 --> 02:46:27.711
Fail.

02:46:28.646 --> 02:46:29.413
Fail.

02:46:30.514 --> 02:46:31.282
Fail.

02:46:31.982 --> 02:46:32.249
Fail.

02:46:33.717 --> 02:46:34.318
Wait, did you just...

02:46:34.685 --> 02:46:36.020
Success.

02:46:37.121 --> 02:46:37.721
Fail.

02:46:39.623 --> 02:46:39.890
...lure them all onto him?

02:46:41.425 --> 02:46:42.993
-Fail.
-That's a good tank.

02:46:45.129 --> 02:46:45.496
Fail.
So, 2 succeeded.

02:46:47.698 --> 02:46:48.232
-That's eight that failed.
-Eight total?

02:46:49.200 --> 02:46:50.034
So, I'm going to back up

02:46:53.771 --> 02:46:54.038
and stop
5 feet in front of Indra.

02:46:55.072 --> 02:46:56.006
Drawing them toward me.

02:46:57.842 --> 02:46:58.909
They have to attack me
and I now have...

02:46:59.944 --> 02:47:00.311
Full Wrath.

02:47:01.512 --> 02:47:02.279
There you go.

02:47:05.749 --> 02:47:06.617
So, describe how that looks to
the trope.

02:47:09.987 --> 02:47:12.690
I back up and say
"Come, lost ones."

02:47:15.726 --> 02:47:16.293
-Lost ones? Yes.
-Perfect.

02:47:17.428 --> 02:47:18.462
"Make your peace quickly."

02:47:21.632 --> 02:47:22.099
The armor just starts to glow
from the latticework

02:47:23.133 --> 02:47:23.334
as they start to...

02:47:24.869 --> 02:47:25.569
as he backs away towards our...

02:47:27.738 --> 02:47:28.005
-You've got it.
-Majorly nerd.

02:47:28.272 --> 02:47:29.106
Awesome

02:47:29.807 --> 02:47:30.941
You watch all these creatures,
even the ones up in your face,

02:47:33.444 --> 02:47:33.944
all of the sudden turn,
except for a couple of them,

02:47:34.612 --> 02:47:35.679
turn towards Mordred.

02:47:38.349 --> 02:47:38.749
and begin to make their move
when it's their next go.

02:47:38.816 --> 02:47:42.386
Remy, you're up.

02:47:43.387 --> 02:47:43.687
Okay.

02:47:43.954 --> 02:47:45.089
Number 1,

02:47:46.590 --> 02:47:47.825
the swarm of insects starts to
get louder and louder

02:47:50.661 --> 02:47:51.295
and for my bonus action I'm
gonna have my swarm of insects

02:47:54.532 --> 02:47:55.332
swarm the 1 that attacked me.

02:47:55.599 --> 02:47:55.966
The 1 that actually
got the hit in.

02:47:56.100 --> 02:47:56.667
You've got it.

02:47:57.268 --> 02:47:59.270
Alrighty.

02:48:00.170 --> 02:48:00.971
There it is...

02:48:01.672 --> 02:48:03.507
Go ahead and
roll the attack on that.

02:48:04.074 --> 02:48:04.408
Twenty.

02:48:05.743 --> 02:48:05.943
Twenty definitely hits.

02:48:07.211 --> 02:48:07.478
Alright.

02:48:10.014 --> 02:48:11.115
So that does a...

02:48:12.850 --> 02:48:15.486
Two D4...

02:48:15.953 --> 02:48:16.086
Five...

02:48:19.623 --> 02:48:19.990
Seven points of damage...

02:48:21.959 --> 02:48:22.393
to the little s**t.

02:48:22.793 --> 02:48:24.128
And then...

02:48:28.198 --> 02:48:28.999
I would like to hold my attack

02:48:31.035 --> 02:48:31.402
until the creatures
move towards...

02:48:32.503 --> 02:48:34.405
You've got it.

02:48:36.774 --> 02:48:37.508
Although, actually (indistinct)

02:48:37.808 --> 02:48:38.909
'cause you start
with a 0 spirit,

02:48:40.644 --> 02:48:41.579
you have to build it up,
and that does cost spirit.

02:48:44.815 --> 02:48:45.583
-Oh, you start with 0!
-Yeah, you've gotta build it up.

02:48:46.684 --> 02:48:47.551
Good to know.

02:48:50.054 --> 02:48:50.821
-That's all good.
-I understand now.

02:48:52.122 --> 02:48:53.057
In that case, screw it,

02:48:56.660 --> 02:48:56.961
I'm gonna maul
the 1 in front of me, too.

02:48:57.928 --> 02:48:58.696
Alright, you've got that.

02:49:00.130 --> 02:49:00.397
-Okay, so...
-And Instantly...

02:49:02.366 --> 02:49:02.566
I'm turned into a...

02:49:06.337 --> 02:49:07.304
A giant were-crocodile.

02:49:09.673 --> 02:49:10.507
Reptilian, very large,

02:49:11.308 --> 02:49:11.609
very large mouth.

02:49:12.443 --> 02:49:13.744
Alright,

02:49:14.311 --> 02:49:14.912
you're using your action to maul
the 1 that's in front of you.

02:49:15.279 --> 02:49:16.280
Go ahead and roll an attack,

02:49:17.414 --> 02:49:18.282
well, use the same attack
as you already rolled.

02:49:19.917 --> 02:49:20.584
Go ahead
and roll damage for the maul

02:49:20.951 --> 02:49:24.622
against the 1 that attacked you.

02:49:25.155 --> 02:49:26.056
Seven.

02:49:26.991 --> 02:49:29.259
Seven damage is still enough.

02:49:30.260 --> 02:49:31.195
As you swoop out,

02:49:33.097 --> 02:49:33.998
you watch
as this giant crocodile's face

02:49:36.000 --> 02:49:36.266
